de-user\" data-userid=\"503\" data-vbnamecard=\"503\">LostLight</a> More to come as the new chapters roll out!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/They<br /> Moderator<br /> Line Developer: <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4261/Onyx-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_24824/Scarred-Lands-new\" target=\"_blank\">Scarred Lands</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25411-travislegge","name":"TravisLegge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25411_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-14T07:48:58-07:00","id":1402808,"title":"","content":"So I was looking forward to maybe seeing this at Gencon (no announcements, just a hope) and then Gencon was cancelled and moved online (for obvious and justifiable reasons).<br /> <br /> Any news then on when we'll get PoD options? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13194-psyclus","name":"Psyclus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-30T16:38:44-07:00","id":1416181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psyclus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/1345677-yugman-s-guide-to-ghelspad?p=1402808#post1402808\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Any news then on when we'll get PoD options? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Once all six chapters roll out, errata is entered, and the compilation exclusives are added. Chapter five came out <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/330492/Yugmans-Guide-to-Ghelspad-Part-Five-5e-OGL\" target=\"_blank\">today at DriveThruRPG </a>Chapter six is due out in November.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/They<br /> Moderator<br /> Line Developer: <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4261/Onyx-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_24824/Scarred-Lands-new\" target=\"_blank\">Scarred Lands</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25411-travislegge","name":"TravisLegge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25411_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T03:34:07-07:00","id":1416222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TravisLegge</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/1345677-yugman-s-guide-to-ghelspad#post1345677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As announced at <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/onyx-path-publishing-announces-vigil-watch-and-yugmans-guide-to-ghelspad-for-the-scarred-lands-rpg/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/onyx-path-pub...red-lands-rpg/</a><br /> <b>Yugman\u2019s Guide to Ghelspad</b> offers new insight into heroes and villains, as well as the tools they use to rise to power, through the eyes of Yugman the Sage. This release will contain:<ul><li>21 new Social Backgrounds expanding the sects &amp; societies introduced in the Scarred Lands Player\u2019s Guide</li> <li>23 new subclasses, with each base class represented</li> <li>6 new Races including Broadreach dwarves, and a revised Hollow Legionnaire</li> <li>New Spells, True Rituals, Magic Items and more!</li> </ul><b>Yugman\u2019s Guide to Ghelspad</b> is written by Chris Bissette (<i>Loot the Room</i>, <i>Breaker of Chains</i>), Oliver Clegg (<i>Ravenloft: City of Eyes</i>, <i>Weekend at Strahd\u2019s</i>), Celeste Conowitch (<i>Blood Sea: The Crimson Abyss 5e</i>, <i>Venture Maidens</i>), Beatriz T. Dias (<i>The Fall of Durgan\u2019s Rest</i>, <i>Off to a Weird Start</i>), Lewis Harris (<i>Destiny 2</i>, <i>Hunter: The Reckoning \u2013 Wayward</i>), Jeremy Hochhalter (<i>Creature Codex for 5th Edition</i>, <i>A Titanic Feast</i>), Megan Mackie (<i>Legendlore RPG</i>), Jessica Ross (<i>Sundered Sisters,</i> <i>Uncaged Volume I</i>), and Christopher Walz (<i>Morty Corgi\u2019s Scroll of Mysteries</i>, <i>The Midnight Revelry</i>).<br /> <br /> Let's talk about it!</div> </div> </div> </div>So, now that we have 5 of the 6 volumes out, let's figure what is missing and what will be in part 6 ^^<br /> <br /> Part 1<br /> 3 races (broadreach dwarf, half-elf, hollow legionnaire), not sure if the dwarf or the hollow legionnaire count as &quot;new&quot;<br /> 5 new subclasses (cleric, druid, fighter x2, warlock)<br /> Spells<br /> Eldricht invocation<br /> <br /> Part 2<br /> 6 social background<br /> 2 races (triton, scrag)<br /> 2 subclasses (rogue x2)<br /> Spells<br /> Blood sea alchemy<br /> <br /> Part 3<br /> 3 social background<br /> 3 subclasses (sorcerer, wizard x2)<br /> Spells<br /> <br /> Part 4<br /> 6 social background<br /> 2 subclasses (paladin, rogue)<br /> Equipment<br /> Magic items<br /> Spells<br /> <br /> Part 5<br /> 6 social background<br /> 3 subclasses (barbarian, fighter, monk)<br /> 2 races (half-elf, minotaur)<br /> <br /> So in total we have already<br /> 21/21 social background<br /> 15/23 subclasses (no bard or ranger subclass)<br /> 7/6 races (or maybe 5 or 6 depending what counts as new)<br /> Spells, Magic items, and more (no true rituals)<br /> <br /> So, unless I can't count, volume 6 will mostly be subclasses with a few true rituals, with at least 1 for the bard and 1 for the ranger, and maybe other miscalneous materials, and a tiny possibility of having 1 new race (quite unlikely though). Given that there are no rangers in the SLPG, I expect that this one will contain more than 1 ranger subclass ^^<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Alain%20Giorla\" target=\"_blank\">Slarecian Vault contributions</a>","edited":{"userid":5793,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5793-haaz","user":"haaz","date":". 10-01-2020, 06:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5793-haaz","name":"haaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-22T15:42:32-08:00","id":1433112,"title":"","content":"So the completed Yugman's Guide is now out, and from the preview it seems to contain a number of Subclasses which are not the the separate volumes (not to mention that it seems it was cheaper to wait for the complete Guide to come out then to buy each Volume separately). Am I missing the subclasses somewhere? Because buying the complete Guide for those subclasses after I bought all of the volumes feels a bit... weird.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-23T16:37:57-08:00","id":1433193,"title":"","content":"So I discovered why I didn't got a link for a free pdf even though I bought all six parts- apparently, I split them between two accounts, with each buying 3 copies... Just my luck","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user